The SVG files in this directory are vendored from Microsoft's Fluent System Icons
(https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons) and are covered by the MIT licence
reproduced below. They are redistributed under VJE's own glyph names and with their fill
colour rewritten to `currentColor` so the palette can tint them; the artwork is unchanged.

Which upstream family each file came from is recorded in the provenance comment at the top
of the file itself, and the whole mapping is icon-map.json beside this notice.

VJE's own artwork -- everything under assets/images/icons/classic/ and
assets/images/icons/fluent/custom/ -- is not covered by this notice. It is the project's own
work under the project's own licence (see the LICENSE at the repository root).

